<h1>API coexistence</h1>
<p>
  This Nest application serves REST under <code>/api</code>, GraphQL at
  <code>/graphql</code>, a TCP microservice, a Nest WebSocket gateway at
  <code>/ws/items</code> and Nestvexa pages, Live actions and realtime from one
  process. Nestvexa adds no global guard, pipe, filter or middleware to them.
</p>
